1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,350
Allah gandakan

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,880
berapa gandaan pahala orang

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,000
beribadah di Makkah?

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,200
100

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,960
ribu

6
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,000
kali ganda.

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Masjid Nabawi, 1000 kali ganda.

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Masjid al-Aqsa, 500 kali ganda.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Makkah ni 100 ribu kali ganda.

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,932
Orang yang beribadah di Makkah,

11
00:00:22,932 --> 00:00:25,000
digandakan 100 ribu pahala.

12
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:28,090
Para ulama berselisih, adakah di

13
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:30,490
Masjidil Haram saja, atau di seluruh

14
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,218
kota suci Makkah itu?

15
00:00:32,218 --> 00:00:34,770
Jumhur ulama menyatakan bahawa 100

16
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:37,480
ribu kali gandaan itu diberikan

17
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:40,000
kepada seluruh kota suci Makkah,

18
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
tidak hanya Masjidil Haram.

19
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,440
Maknanya, di dalam bilik kita, di

20
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:48,110
hotel pun, kalau kita baca Quran,

21
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:50,000
dapat gandaan 100 ribu kali ganda.

22
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,630
Kita solat dhuha, di dalam masjid

23
00:00:52,630 --> 00:00:54,000
pun dapat 100 ribu kali ganda.

24
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,360
Walaupun

25
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,680
itu pun, fadilat kita sembahyang di

26
00:00:57,680 --> 00:01:00,200
masjid itu lebihlah

27
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,000
afdal.

28
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,450
Macam orang sembahyang masjid, sama

29
00:01:04,450 --> 00:01:06,300
ke orang sembahyang saf belakang

30
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:08,000
dengan saf depan?

31
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Tidak sama, saf depanlah lebih afdal.

32
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,870
Sama ke orang sembahyang di luar,

33
00:01:14,870 --> 00:01:17,000
jalan raya itu, dengan orang depan?

34
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Di depan lagi afdal.
